  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Skills Program (Solomon Islands)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Budget support to Ministry Education and Human Resources Development for Skills awards to rural training centres (RTC) around Solomon Islands. Supporting Solomon Islands Government&apos;s systems strengthening and governance frameworks.

Separate Service Order to contract ASIPS to respond and efficiently procure and deliver PPE for student recipients of the Australia Skills Award, improve public diplomacy, support program M&amp;E and other administrative support as agreed with Post.

Scope of works for refurbishment of Solomon Islands National University (SINU) TAFE facilities and build of Afutara Rural Training Center (Australia Skills Award).</narrative>
  </description>
